  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1d779d4715048234dbbf2415be188cb0, type: 3}
  m_Name: AgedAdventurer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Title: AgedAdventurer
  Prompt: You pass a horse-driven cart on the road, led by an ancient horse and even
    older horsedriver. As you slow down to greet him, he frowns. "I know the look
    of an unprepared novice. You'll soon get yourself killed on the road ahead."
    He looks back at his wagon. "I could give you some old gear I have. I'm too old
    to make use of it anyways."
  Sprite: {fileID: 0}
  ChoicesToDisplay: 1
  Choices:
  - Text: Accept the gift.
    SuccessChance: 1
    _successText: 
    SuccessOutcomeData:
      Text: The old man reaches behind him and hands you a wrapped package. Tearing
        away faded cloth, you reveal a suprisingly polished piece of adventuring
        gear. Looking up at the man, he has a nostalgic look on his face. You thank
        him, and go on your way.
      Outcomes:
      - Type: 2
        _moneyDelta: 0
        _equipment: {fileID: 0}
        _newHire: {fileID: 0}
        _damageAmount: 0
        _numMapTiles: 0
    FailureOutcomeData:
      Text: 
      Outcomes: []
